  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Gender Equality and Child Rights - Prevention of Gender-Based Violence</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project will work with women, children and young people who live with abuse, exploitation, sexual and gender-based violence, and alcohol and drug-related harm, increasing the risk of developing mental health problems.  The project will give access to services including mental health and community-based and policy-level interventions for these groups. This specifically includes people with permanent or temporary mental impairments.</narrative>
  </description>
